  "title": "Emmy Award-winning ESPN analyst Mina Kimes to host the 2026 Scripps National Spelling Bee",
  "summary": "Nationally acclaimed ESPN senior writer and Emmy Award-winning analyst Mina Kimes will bring her passion for storytelling to the 2026 Scripps National Spelling Bee as host of its televised semifinals and finals – May 27 and May 28 – on ION.",
